0.039,"r1_spy":0.0315,"r5_spy":0.0863,"r1_sector":0.007,"r5_sector":0.0353,"etf":"XLU"}}],"quotes":[{"c":"LNT 2016 Q2","e":"lnt","d":"2016-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Pat Kampling","x":"In addition to the RPU request of 500 megawatt of new wind investments, we anticipate filing a restructuring request with the IUB maybe this quarter to transfer the Franklin County wind farm from Alliant Energy Resources to IPL.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2016 Q2","e":"lnt","d":"2016-08-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"During the rest of this year, we'll be supporting the filings to add up to 500 megawatts of wind in Iowa and later this quarter, we plan to file a restructuring request to transfer the Franklin County wind farm from Alliant Energy Resources to IPL.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2016 Q3","e":"lnt","d":"2016-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"This filing includes new pricing options and an increase in the fixed charge component of tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2016 Q4","e":"lnt","d":"2017-02-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Susan Gille","x":"I’ll pass it on to Robert.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2017 Q2","e":"lnt","d":"2017-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Pat Kampling","x":"Solar investment such as these, as well as the Beyond Solar tariff recently filed in Iowa, will help us meet our customers’ growing interest in cleaner and distributed forms of energy.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2019 Q2","e":"lnt","d":"2019-08-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John Larsen","x":"Solar was the focus of some new tariffs recently approved by the Public Service Commission of Wisconsin.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2019 Q2","e":"lnt","d":"2019-08-02","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John Larsen","x":"Three new tariffs were approved that will help enable us to provide more renewable options for our customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2019 Q4","e":"lnt","d":"2020-02-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"A few of our largest customers in Iowa experienced temporary operational issues in 2019 and economic conditions resulting from additional tariffs last year impacted certain manufacturing customers production resulting in a lower industrial demand.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2020 Q1","e":"lnt","d":"2020-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"Lastly, during times of low energy prices like now, we have an opportunity to capture and keep a portion of fuel cost savings through WPL’s fuel sharing mechanism, which is also expected to help offset a portion of the COVID-19 impacts in 2020.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2020 Q1","e":"lnt","d":"2020-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Larsen","x":"Certainly, with the COVID impacts, we know, we have to further reduce – the good news here is, we had a lot of work internally on planning for cost reduction.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2020 Q3","e":"lnt","d":"2020-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"This strategic decision will lead to a medium and substantial fuel cost savings for our customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2020 Q4","e":"lnt","d":"2021-02-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"The renewable energy rider will allow IPL to recover costs of the incremental rate base from our recently completed one gigawatt of wind while also passing on significant incremental production tax credits and fuel cost savings to our customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2022 Q1","e":"lnt","d":"2022-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John Larsen","x":"Throughout the process of the filing our team demonstrated transparency regarding the current environment of supply chain and tariff risks and we're committed to continuing that transparency as we continue our journey towards a clean energy future.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2022 Q1","e":"lnt","d":"2022-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"As John noted, we took, yeah, we took actions after the first petition in 2021 to mitigate the impacts of the potential tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2022 Q1","e":"lnt","d":"2022-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"That tax rate change once we see that would actually translate into some lower costs that we would pass through that rider.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2022 Q1","e":"lnt","d":"2022-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"And the fact that those costs will be lower and that will pass through our transmission rider immediately to customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2022 Q1","e":"lnt","d":"2022-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Larsen","x":"As you know, there's no question about it, but as you know, we put in place our cost reduction efforts in mitigation.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2022 Q1","e":"lnt","d":"2022-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Larsen","x":"I might, start on the cost reduction.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2022 Q2","e":"lnt","d":"2022-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"John Larsen","x":"You may recall the topic of discussion last quarter was the potential for added tariffs to our projects.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2022 Q2","e":"lnt","d":"2022-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"We are also encouraged by the Biden administration’s executive order in June to establish a two year moratorium on tariffs related to the investigation by the Department of Commerce.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2022 Q2","e":"lnt","d":"2022-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Unidentified Analyst","x":"And I’ll pass it on here.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2022 Q4","e":"lnt","d":"2023-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Larsen","x":"Our wind generation produced the most wind energy in our history, providing approximately $160 million of fuel cost savings for our customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2022 Q4","e":"lnt","d":"2023-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"As we look to 2023, we anticipate operating and maintenance expenses will be lower than 2022, continuing our trend of flat to declining O&M to enable cost savings for our customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2023 Q1","e":"lnt","d":"2023-05-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"And in Iowa, we have already started passing these lower fuel cost benefits on to our customers through the monthly fuel cost tariff.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2023 Q1","e":"lnt","d":"2023-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Larsen","x":"We believe this will improve customer satisfaction and provide cost savings and efficiencies.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2023 Q2","e":"lnt","d":"2023-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"And in Iowa, we have already started passing these lower fuel cost benefits onto our customers through the monthly fuel cost tariff in 2023.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2023 Q3","e":"lnt","d":"2023-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Larsen","x":"This helps us reduce our financing needs, create substantial cost savings for our customers, all while taking advantage of zero fuel cost resources and reducing our greenhouse gas emissions.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2024 Q2","e":"lnt","d":"2024-08-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"So, that gives us the confidence to reaffirm the guidance of 2.99 to 3.13, and we will continue to work on that as we go through the rest of the year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2024 Q3","e":"lnt","d":"2024-11-01","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Julian Dumoulin-Smith","x":"And then related here, I know you mentioned a few different times in your remarks about this, you know, the ICR and just working on the appropriate tariff structure.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2024 Q3","e":"lnt","d":"2024-11-01","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Julian Dumoulin-Smith","x":"Again, I get that there's a few different permutations, but how would you think about level setting here, especially in the back end of that plan, given the ICR tariff and the contributions from these new data centers?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2024 Q3","e":"lnt","d":"2024-11-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"As part of these efforts, we are restructuring our workforce.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2024 Q4","e":"lnt","d":"2025-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"We also completed restructuring activities in the fourth quarter of 2024, which resulted in a 5% reduction in our workforce for individuals who chose a voluntary employee separation package, which will provide sustainable cost savings in the future.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2024 Q4","e":"lnt","d":"2025-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Durian","x":"Partially offset by some of the fuel cost savings from those projects as well as some of the tax benefits.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2025 Q1","e":"lnt","d":"2025-05-09","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lisa Barton","x":"Lastly, extending the timing of some of our renewable and battery investments allows us to reduce risks related to tariff and tax policy uncertainty while also lengthening our capital expenditure plan into the future, strengthening our position to deliver financial consistency over the long term.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2025 Q1","e":"lnt","d":"2025-05-09","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lisa Barton","x":"And one of the things to note is still with that 20% tariff that would be imposed on those batteries, that's still the lowest cost in terms of those batteries from China are still lower cost than domestically produced.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"LNT 2026 Q3","e":"lnt","d":"2026-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lisa Barton","x":"In Wisconsin, economic development creates an opportunity to spread fixed system costs across a broader customer b